;border-width:0px\"><strong>Ibento<\/strong> : Event organiser app. Flutter. Developed a mobile app for event organisation, room planner, gestion of expenses.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details has-ast-global-color-3-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-badc4e7fa86a5fa4d442bb093b189286 is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\" style=\"background-color:#ffffffd1\"><summary>2021 &#8211; 2025 <strong>Master\u2019s in Computer Science (Management specialization)<\/strong><\/summary>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Academic Success Prediction<\/strong> : Flask, Docker, GCP. Built a machine learning model predicting student performance with a web dashboard.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Empty Shelf Detection<\/strong> : YOLOv3. Trained and deployed a computer vision model for retail shelf monitoring.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Gardening Management App<\/strong> : Flutter, Firebase. Developed a mobile app for plant care and task tracking using Agile Scrum.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Master Thesis<\/strong> : Automated Generation of Impactful Text Formatting Using LLMs.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/details>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:24px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull wp-duotone-unset-2\" style=\"margin-top:0;padding-top:48px;padding-right:48px;padding-bottom:48px;padding-left:48px;min-height:543px;aspect-ratio:unset;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"541\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-105 size-large\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Capture-decran-du-2025-12-29-12-42-13-1024x541.png\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Capture-decran-du-2025-12-29-12-42-13-1024x541.png 1024w, https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Capture-decran-du-2025-12-29-12-42-13-3