rated services through APIs and automated the full generation pipeline<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-ast-global-color-2-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-06b274094cf24b3f76e58a0f204d7d59\">This project combined applied AI, MLOps, DevOps, and full-stack development in a real-world setting.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:24px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull is-light wp-duotone-unset-3\" style=\"margin-top:0;padding-top:48px;padding-right:48px;padding-bottom:48px;padding-left:48px;min-height:66vh;aspect-ratio:unset;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-107 size-large\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/558777624_1619643992651269_1775453935461490859_n-768x1024.jpg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/558777624_1619643992651269_1775453935461490859_n-768x1024.jpg 768w, https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/558777624_1619643992651269_1775453935461490859_n-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/558777624_1619643992651269_1775453935461490859_n-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/558777624_1619643992651269_1775453935461490859_n.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" \/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-ast-global-color-0-background-color has-background-dim-10 has-background-dim\"><\/span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-0b562c1c wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left has-white-color has-text-color has-large-font-size\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1;text-transform:uppercase\">Centre \u00c9nerg\u00e9tique<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-ast-global-color-4-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7af07cd09d1111f26be70c93121c4b2b\">Digital Media Consultant <\/h2>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details has-ast-global-color-3-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-60251395822288754010dd873fc5ef0d is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\" style=\"background-color:#ffffffd1\"><summary>2014 &#8211; Present : Project carried out for a family massage center<\/summary>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Communication and digital marketing project management<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Creation and management of websites on Odoo and Vistaprint, including structuring, design, and publishing. <\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Graphic design: flyers, business cards, brochures, and development of a consistent visual identity for the center. <\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Digital marketing management: Google Maps campaigns, content creation, and community management for Instagram and YouTube accounts.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Implementation of automated email campaigns to promote the center\u2019s training programs and events. <\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Optimization of online presence and local SEO through Google Business and Google Maps.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Creation of photo and video content, editing of replays, and distribution across relevant platforms.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/details>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"about-me\" class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-large-font-size\">More About Me<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:29px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-center is-style-default\" style=\"grid-template-columns:56% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"991\" height=\"559\" src=\"https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/2modification.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-129 size-full\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/2modification.png 991w, https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/2modification-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/2modification-768x433.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 991px) 100vw, 991px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#000000\"><strong><strong>My Philosophy: Listen first, Code later<\/strong><\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#636363;font-size:17px;line-height:1.1\">I don\u2019t just \u00ab\u00a0write code.\u00a0\u00bb I help businesses breathe easier. My approach is simple: I listen to what\u2019s blocking you, I understand the goal, and then I build the automation to fix it.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#636363;font-size:17px;line-height:1.1\">Whether it&rsquo;s a high-scale Cloud system or a small business owner\u2019s marketing, my goal is the same: <strong>I take care of the \u00ab\u00a0heavy lifting\u00a0\u00bb so you can focus on what you actually love doing.<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-center is-style-default\" style=\"grid-template-columns:auto 56%\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#000000\"><strong><strong><strong>Beyond the Code<\/strong><\/strong><\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#636363;font-size:17px;line-height:1.1\">I\u2019m a creator at heart. When I\u2019m not fine-tuning AI, I\u2019m probably <strong>drawing or building something with my hands<\/strong>. There\u2019s a special kind of satisfaction in seeing an idea become a real object (or a real line of code).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#636363;font-size:17px;line-height:1.1\">I also travel to keep my perspectives wide and watch a lot of cinema to understand different stories. I truly believe that to be a great engineer, you first have to be a curious and empathetic human being.<\/p>\n<\/div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"578\" src=\"https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/1modification-1024x578.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-130 size-full\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/1modification-1024x578.png 1024w, https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/1modification-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/1modification-768x434.png 768w, https:\/\/lionellr.github.io\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/1modification.png 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide has-ast-global-color-4-color has-ast-global-color-6-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-483c7daab6165efeea13de4a8dcff2c0 is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4201e9eb wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group 